{"id":83,"name":"المطففين","transliteration":"Al-Mutaffifin","translation_fr":"Les fraudeurs","translation_en":"The Defrauding","type":"meccan","total_verses":36,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَيۡلٞ لِّلۡمُطَفِّفِينَ","translation_fr":"Malheur aux fraudeurs","translation_en":"Woe to those who give less [than due]","transliteration":"Waylun lilmutaffifeena"},{"id":2,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ إِذَا ٱكۡتَالُواْ عَلَى ٱلنَّاسِ يَسۡتَوۡفُونَ","translation_fr":"qui, lorsqu'ils font mesurer pour eux-mêmes exigent la pleine mesure","translation_en":"Who, when they take a measure from people, take in full","transliteration":"Allatheena itha iktaloo AAala alnnasi yastawfoona"},{"id":3,"text":"وَإِذَا كَالُوهُمۡ أَو وَّزَنُوهُمۡ يُخۡسِرُونَ","translation_fr":"et qui lorsqu'eux-mêmes mesurent ou pèsent pour les autres, [leur] causent perte","translation_en":"But if they give by measure or by weight to them, they cause loss","transliteration":"Waitha kaloohum aw wazanoohum yukhsiroona"},{"id":4,"text":"أَلَا يَظُنُّ أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ أَنَّهُم مَّبۡعُوثُونَ","translation_fr":"Ceux-là ne pensent-ils pas qu'ils seront ressuscités","translation_en":"Do they not think that they will be resurrected","transliteration":"Ala yathunnu olaika annahum mabAAoothoona"},{"id":5,"text":"لِيَوۡمٍ عَظِيمٖ","translation_fr":"en un jour terrible","translation_en":"For a tremendous Day","transliteration":"Liyawmin AAatheemin"},{"id":6,"text":"يَوۡمَ يَقُومُ ٱلنَّاسُ لِرَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","translation_fr":"le jour où les gens se tiendront debout devant le Seigneur de l'Univers","translation_en":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the worlds","transliteration":"Yawma yaqoomu alnnasu lirabbi alAAalameena"},{"id":7,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَٰبَ ٱلۡفُجَّارِ لَفِي سِجِّينٖ","translation_fr":"Non...! Mais en vérité le livre des libertins sera dans le Sijjîn","translation_en":"No! Indeed, the record of the wicked is in sijjeen","transliteration":"Kalla inna kitaba alfujjari lafee sijjeenin"},{"id":8,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا سِجِّينٞ","translation_fr":"et qui te dira ce qu'est le Sijjîn","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is sijjeen","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma sijjeenun"},{"id":9,"text":"كِتَٰبٞ مَّرۡقُومٞ","translation_fr":"Un livre déjà cacheté (achevé)","translation_en":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed","transliteration":"Kitabun marqoomun"},{"id":10,"text":"وَيۡلٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ","translation_fr":"Malheur, ce jour-là, aux négateurs","translation_en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers","transliteration":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena"},{"id":11,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُكَذِّبُونَ بِيَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"qui démentent le jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"Who deny the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Allatheena yukaththiboona biyawmi alddeeni"},{"id":12,"text":"وَمَا يُكَذِّبُ بِهِۦٓ إِلَّا كُلُّ مُعۡتَدٍ أَثِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Or, ne le dément que tout transgresseur, pécheur","translation_en":"And none deny it except every sinful transgressor","transliteration":"Wama yukaththibu bihi illa kullu muAAtadin atheemin"},{"id":13,"text":"إِذَا تُتۡلَىٰ عَلَيۡهِ ءَايَٰتُنَا قَالَ أَسَٰطِيرُ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","translation_fr":"qui, lorsque Nos versets lui sont récités, dit: «[Ce sont] des contes d'anciens!»","translation_en":"When Our verses are recited to him, he says, \"Legends of the former peoples","transliteration":"Itha tutla AAalayhi ayatuna qala asateeru alawwaleena"},{"id":14,"text":"كَلَّاۖ بَلۡۜ رَانَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِم مَّا كَانُواْ يَكۡسِبُونَ","translation_fr":"Pas du tout, mais ce qu'ils ont accompli couvre leurs cœurs","translation_en":"No! Rather, the stain has covered their hearts of that which they were earning","transliteration":"Kalla bal rana AAala quloobihim ma kanoo yaksiboona"},{"id":15,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهُمۡ عَن رَّبِّهِمۡ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّمَحۡجُوبُونَ","translation_fr":"Qu'ils prennent garde! En vérité ce jour-là un voile les empêchera de voir leur Seigneur","translation_en":"No! Indeed, from their Lord, that Day, they will be partitioned","transliteration":"Kalla innahum AAan rabbihim yawmaithin lamahjooboona"},{"id":16,"text":"ثُمَّ إِنَّهُمۡ لَصَالُواْ ٱلۡجَحِيمِ","translation_fr":"ensuite, ils brûleront certes, dans la Fournaise","translation_en":"Then indeed, they will [enter and] burn in Hellfire","transliteration":"Thumma innahum lasaloo aljaheemi"},{"id":17,"text":"ثُمَّ يُقَالُ هَٰذَا ٱلَّذِي كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","translation_fr":"on [leur] dira alors: «Voilà ce que vous traitiez de mensonge!»","translation_en":"Then it will be said [to them], \"This is what you used to deny","transliteration":"Thumma yuqalu hatha allathee kuntum bihi tukaththiboona"},{"id":18,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّ كِتَٰبَ ٱلۡأَبۡرَارِ لَفِي عِلِّيِّينَ","translation_fr":"Qu'ils prennent garde! Le livre des bons sera dans l'Illiyûn","translation_en":"No! Indeed, the record of the righteous is in 'illiyyun","transliteration":"Kalla inna kitaba alabrari lafee AAilliyyeena"},{"id":19,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا عِلِّيُّونَ","translation_fr":"et qui te dira ce qu'est l'Illiyûn","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is 'illiyyun","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma AAilliyyoona"},{"id":20,"text":"كِتَٰبٞ مَّرۡقُومٞ","translation_fr":"un livre cacheté","translation_en":"It is [their destination recorded in] a register inscribed","transliteration":"Kitabun marqoomun"},{"id":21,"text":"يَشۡهَدُهُ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ","translation_fr":"Les rapprochés [d'Allah: les Anges] en témoignent","translation_en":"Which is witnessed by those brought near [to Allah]","transliteration":"Yashhaduhu almuqarraboona"},{"id":22,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ لَفِي نَعِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Les bons seront dans [un Jardin] de délice","translation_en":"Indeed, the righteous will be in pleasure","transliteration":"Inna alabrara lafee naAAeemin"},{"id":23,"text":"عَلَى ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ","translation_fr":"sur les divans, ils regardent","translation_en":"On adorned couches, observing","transliteration":"AAala alaraiki yanthuroona"},{"id":24,"text":"تَعۡرِفُ فِي وُجُوهِهِمۡ نَضۡرَةَ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation_fr":"Tu reconnaîtras sur leurs visages, l'éclat de la félicité","translation_en":"You will recognize in their faces the radiance of pleasure","transliteration":"TaAArifu fee wujoohihim nadrata alnnaAAeemi"},{"id":25,"text":"يُسۡقَوۡنَ مِن رَّحِيقٖ مَّخۡتُومٍ","translation_fr":"On leur sert à boire un nectar pur, cacheté","translation_en":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed","transliteration":"Yusqawna min raheeqin makhtoomin"},{"id":26,"text":"خِتَٰمُهُۥ مِسۡكٞۚ وَفِي ذَٰلِكَ فَلۡيَتَنَافَسِ ٱلۡمُتَنَٰفِسُونَ","translation_fr":"laissant un arrière-goût de musc. Que ceux qui la convoitent entrent en compétition [pour l'acquérir]","translation_en":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete","transliteration":"Khitamuhu miskun wafee thalika falyatanafasi almutanafisoona"},{"id":27,"text":"وَمِزَاجُهُۥ مِن تَسۡنِيمٍ","translation_fr":"Il est mélangé à la boisson de Tasnîm","translation_en":"And its mixture is of Tasneem","transliteration":"Wamizajuhu min tasneemin"},{"id":28,"text":"عَيۡنٗا يَشۡرَبُ بِهَا ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ","translation_fr":"source dont les rapprochés boivent","translation_en":"A spring from which those near [to Allah] drink","transliteration":"AAaynan yashrabu biha almuqarraboona"},{"id":29,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ أَجۡرَمُواْ كَانُواْ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ يَضۡحَكُونَ","translation_fr":"Les criminels riaient de ceux qui croyaient","translation_en":"Indeed, those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed","transliteration":"Inna allatheena ajramoo kanoo mina allatheena amanoo yadhakoona"},{"id":30,"text":"وَإِذَا مَرُّواْ بِهِمۡ يَتَغَامَزُونَ","translation_fr":"et, passant près d'eux, ils se faisaient des œillades","translation_en":"And when they passed by them, they would exchange derisive glances","transliteration":"Waitha marroo bihim yataghamazoona"},{"id":31,"text":"وَإِذَا ٱنقَلَبُوٓاْ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِمُ ٱنقَلَبُواْ فَكِهِينَ","translation_fr":"et, retournant dans leurs familles, ils retournaient en plaisantant","translation_en":"And when they returned to their people, they would return jesting","transliteration":"Waitha inqalaboo ila ahlihimu inqalaboo fakiheena"},{"id":32,"text":"وَإِذَا رَأَوۡهُمۡ قَالُوٓاْ إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ لَضَآلُّونَ","translation_fr":"et les voyant, ils disaient: «Ce sont vraiment ceux-là les égarés»","translation_en":"And when they saw them, they would say, \"Indeed, those are truly lost","transliteration":"Waitha raawhum qaloo inna haolai ladalloona"},{"id":33,"text":"وَمَآ أُرۡسِلُواْ عَلَيۡهِمۡ حَٰفِظِينَ","translation_fr":"Or, ils n'ont pas été envoyés pour être leurs gardiens","translation_en":"But they had not been sent as guardians over them","transliteration":"Wama orsiloo AAalayhim hafitheena"},{"id":34,"text":"فَٱلۡيَوۡمَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ مِنَ ٱلۡكُفَّارِ يَضۡحَكُونَ","translation_fr":"Aujourd'hui, donc, ce sont ceux qui ont cru qui rient des infidèles","translation_en":"So Today those who believed are laughing at the disbelievers","transliteration":"Faalyawma allatheena amanoo mina alkuffari yadhakoona"},{"id":35,"text":"عَلَى ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ يَنظُرُونَ","translation_fr":"sur les divans, ils regardent","translation_en":"On adorned couches, observing","transliteration":"AAala alaraiki yanthuroona"},{"id":36,"text":"هَلۡ ثُوِّبَ ٱلۡكُفَّارُ مَا كَانُواْ يَفۡعَلُونَ","translation_fr":"Est-ce que les infidèles ont eu la récompense de ce qu'ils faisaient","translation_en":"Have the disbelievers [not] been rewarded [this Day] for what they used to do","transliteration":"Hal thuwwiba alkuffaru ma kanoo yafAAaloona"}]}